  "body": "Brand new, beautifully considered and refreshingly different - discover easy coastal living without the crowds of a high-density development.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a peaceful cul-de-sac in a highly desirable coastal neighbourhood, this freestanding, freehold home offers a wonderful sense of independence, with just two properties sharing the driveway. A refreshing alternative to the multi-home developments becoming increasingly common in the area.\r\n\r\nDesigned for those who appreciate contemporary comfort without the demands of a large property, this sun-filled home brings together smart design, quality finishes and effortless everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtfully planned layout features four bedrooms, all positioned on the upper level, along with 2.5 bathrooms and a versatile study space. Downstairs, the welcoming living and dining area connects easily with the outdoors, creating a relaxed setting for everyday enjoyment.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is a real highlight. Beautifully designed with exceptional attention to functionality, it offers an abundance of cleverly incorporated storage, ensuring everything has its place. Stylish, practical and wonderfully easy to work in.\r\n\r\nOutside, a sunny, easy-care garden and small lawn offer just enough green space to enjoy without taking up your weekends. An internal-access garage, additional parking and a heat pump system add to the everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nPerfectly suited to smaller families, professional couples or downsizers seeking a modern lock-up-and-leave lifestyle, this is a home where practicality and comfort go hand in hand.\r\n\r\nAnd the location is equally appealing. Beautiful beaches, local cafe's excellent schooling and the sought-after Rangitoto College zone are all part of the lifestyle on offer.\r\n\r\nAn appealing combination of privacy, sunshine and low-maintenance coastal living, all ready for you to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to showing you through.",
